# Agent Governance
- AI agents are empowered but not trusted: run `com.agenticqa.governance.AgentValidator` before completion.
- Write drafts only under `agent-generated/`; promote to `src/` only when asked.
- QA Reviewer is review-only by default — no silent edits.
- Forbidden in tests: hardcoded secrets/URLs, fixed waits, direct browser/HTTP bootstrap.
- Runtime tests must never call LLM APIs.
- Always consult `.ai/knowledge/automation-inventory.md` before creating tests.
